  "details": "The coreutils packages contain the GNU Core Utilities and represent a combination of the previously used GNU fileutils, sh-utils, and textutils packages.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * coreutils: GNU coreutils unexpand: Denial of Service via crafted tab stop values (CVE-2026-56392)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
